  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HCFC Phase-out Management Plan (Stage III)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The HCFC Phase-out Management Plan (Stage III) for Argentina encompasses the compliance strategy and action plan for the reduction of the consumption of substances controlled under Annex C Group I (HCFCs) of the Montreal Protocol for Argentina. The Government of Argentina and UNIDO shall implement sector-specific activities under the overarching national HCFC phase out strategy in key industries, namely the refrigeration and air conditioning manufacturing and service sectors, as well as the HCFC production sector.</narrative>
  </description>
